Compare / Evaluate flow as a page, kept stale "(Sidebar)" headings for
Cohorts runs and simulation runs, and mentioned a class scope that the
editor does not offer. Rewrote it as a full Intelligence chapter and synced
the in-app Help Center and README.

Changes:

1. docs/user-guide.md
   New "Step 4: Intelligence (Cohorts, Discovery & Simulation)" chapter:
   overview table, prerequisites, shared page features, Cohorts,
   Communities (plain words, usage, reading results, internals), Patterns
   (steps, Detect settings table, reading a diagram, saved runs), choosing
   between tools, Scenarios (scope and fact kinds, run pipeline, list,
   editor, run history location), new Compare section (Graphs, Evaluate,
   best practices), end-to-end energy example, limits and troubleshooting;
